{
  "uid": "retail-models",
  "title": "Models",
  "description": "Every model version, what the promotion gate decided, and how the models compare with simple baselines.",
  "tags": [
    "retail-retention",
    "mlflow",
    "models"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": false,
  "refresh": "5m",
  "time": {
    "from": "2010-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
    "to": "2012-02-01T00:00:00.000Z"
  },
  "timezone": "utc",
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Model versions and what the gate decided",
      "description": "Every registered version of the project's models, newest first. The promotion gate decides whether a new version replaces the champion; a rejection is a normal result, and the previous champion keeps serving. The decision is written as text as well as coloured.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "retail-warehouse"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "retail-warehouse"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "editorMode": "code",
          "rawSql": "SELECT model_name AS model, version, created_at AS created, decision, is_champion AS champion, left(reason, 220) AS reason FROM ml.monitor_model_versions ORDER BY model_name, version DESC"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "decision"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "promoted": {
                        "text": "promoted",
                        "color": "green",
                        "index": 0
                      },
                      "rejected": {
                        "text": "rejected",
                        "color": "red",
                        "index": 1
                      },
                      "unrecorded": {
                        "text": "unrecorded",
                        "color": "orange",
                        "index": 2
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-text"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "champion"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "true": {
                        "text": "champion",
                        "color": "blue",
                        "index": 0
                      },
                      "false": {
                        "text": "",
                        "index": 1
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-text"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "version"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 80
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "reason"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 560
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "barchart",
      "title": "Churn model: precision-recall AUC on the test snapshot, by version",
      "description": "Higher is better. The model against two simple baselines (customers ranked by how long since they last bought, and a statistical buy-till-you-die model). The promotion gate needs the model's lead over the recency baseline to be statistically clear, not just positive. Versions that were not evaluated against a baseline with a confidence interval are left out: their numbers were measured differently and would not compare.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "retail-warehouse"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "retail-warehouse"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "editorMode": "code",
          "rawSql": "SELECT version::text AS version, max(value) FILTER (WHERE metric = 'test_pr_auc') AS \"model\", max(value) FILTER (WHERE metric = 'baseline_recency_test_pr_auc') AS \"recency baseline\", max(value) FILTER (WHERE metric = 'baseline_bgnbd_test_pr_auc') AS \"BG/NBD baseline\" FROM ml.monitor_model_metrics WHERE model_name = 'retail-churn-classifier' GROUP BY version HAVING max(value) FILTER (WHERE metric = 'test_pr_auc_vs_recency_gain') IS NOT NULL ORDER BY version"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "orientation": "auto",
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        },
        "barWidth": 0.8,
        "groupWidth": 0.75,
        "showValue": "auto",
        "stacking": "none",
        "xTickLabelRotation": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "#3B82F6"
          },
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 85,
            "lineWidth": 0,
            "gradientMode": "none"
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "model"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#3B82F6"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "recency baseline"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#6B7280"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "BG/NBD baseline"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#8B5CF6"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Gain over the recency baseline, by backtest origin (champion)",
      "description": "How much better the champion churn model ranks than the recency baseline at each time origin (precision-recall AUC difference), with its 95% interval. Above the zero line means better. The origins are dates in the dataset, not today's date.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "retail-warehouse"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "retail-warehouse"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "time_series",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "editorMode": "code",
          "rawSql": "SELECT origin::timestamp AS time, gain AS \"gain\", gain_ci_low AS \"95% interval, low\", gain_ci_high AS \"95% interval, high\" FROM ml.monitor_backtest WHERE version = (SELECT version FROM ml.monitor_model_versions WHERE model_name = 'retail-churn-classifier' AND is_champion) ORDER BY origin"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "always",
            "pointSize": 7,
            "spanNulls": true,
            "axisSoftMin": 0,
            "axisPlacement": "auto"
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "gain"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#3B82F6"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineWidth",
                "value": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "95% interval, low"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#6B7280"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineWidth",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineStyle",
                "value": {
                  "fill": "dash",
                  "dash": [
                    8,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "95% interval, high"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#6B7280"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineWidth",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineStyle",
                "value": {
                  "fill": "dash",
                  "dash": [
                    8,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "barchart",
      "title": "Churn model: calibration error, by version",
      "description": "Expected calibration error on the test snapshot: how far the predicted probabilities are from the observed rates. Lower is better, and the ranking multiplies the probability, so it matters. Versions that were not evaluated against a baseline with a confidence interval are left out: their numbers were measured differently and would not compare.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "retail-warehouse"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 17
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "retail-warehouse"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "editorMode": "code",
          "rawSql": "SELECT version::text AS version, max(value) FILTER (WHERE metric = 'test_ece') AS \"calibration error\" FROM ml.monitor_model_metrics WHERE model_name = 'retail-churn-classifier' GROUP BY version HAVING max(value) FILTER (WHERE metric = 'test_pr_auc_vs_recency_gain') IS NOT NULL ORDER BY version"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "orientation": "auto",
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": false
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
