      "type": "barchart",
      "title": "Value model: rank correlation with real spend, by version",
      "description": "Spearman correlation between predicted and actual 90-day spend on the test snapshot (higher is better), against the naive forecast of repeating last quarter's spend. Versions that were not evaluated against a baseline with a confidence interval are left out: their numbers were measured differently and would not compare.",
